									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d45aad2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5d45aad2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The beauty-adjacent niche <span class="hl">that's genuinely two businesses at once</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-157ee956 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="157ee956" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-368ab8e4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="368ab8e4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-205193de elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="205193de" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Wellness centers sell to individuals booking IV drips and cryotherapy on their phone, and to HR departments negotiating a corporate wellness contract on a call. Almost no other beauty-adjacent business runs a genuine B2B sales motion alongside its consumer marketing — and treating both as one audience wastes real revenue on both sides.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-76498bb1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="76498bb1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The community and identity angle is real, not fluff</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-835726b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="835726b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Modern wellness facilities increasingly position themselves as social recovery hubs, not just treatment providers — client motivations genuinely include connecting with like-minded people pursuing similar health goals, which means content and events matter as much as the treatment menu itself.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65d16a2b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="65d16a2b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Session length varies wildly, and that's a genuine differentiator</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-338a1834 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="338a1834" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A 3-minute whole-body cryotherapy session and a 90-minute hyperbaric oxygen session serve completely different moments in a client&#8217;s day — marketing that leads with &#8220;fits your lunch break&#8221; or &#8220;your Sunday reset&#8221; converts far better than a flat treatment list.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ca64441 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1ca64441" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32b7bdcd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="32b7bdcd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Wellness centers, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">2 audiences</b><span>— consumer clients and B2B corporate buyers</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3min-90min</b><span>— session length spans wildly by modality</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Community-driven</b><span>— identity and belonging are real motivators</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Multi-modality</b><span>— bundling drives the highest membership value</span></div>								</div>
